    "q": "How do I get tartar off my dog's teeth at home?",
    "a": "You can't safely remove hardened tartar at home. Brushing helps prevent plaque and new tartar from building up, but removing established tartar needs professional scaling by your vet, done under general anesthesia. Don't scrape your dog's teeth with tools."
